; ************************************************************************************************
; ************************************************************************************************
;
;		Name:		zzlowbank.footer
;		Purpose:	The banked section in low RAM, for the links that run tests in the emulator.
;		Created:	15th September 2026
;
; ************************************************************************************************
; ************************************************************************************************
;
;		The runtime's "build" and "checkall" links and the polynomials "build" link run code.prg
;		with nothing in bank 1, so the banked section goes inside the code section, where this
;		file is linked. In the runtime links that is before testend.asm, whose test object
;		follows the code.
;
;		64tass will not take a .dsection nested inside .section code. The .fill has no value, so
;		it reserves the room without writing it, and the banked section is placed over that room.
;
;		A .footer, not .asm, so build.py leaves it out of the library.
;
; ************************************************************************************************

		.section code
LowBankedCode:
		.fill 	LowBankedEnd - LowBankedCode 	; reserved, not written
		.send code

		* = LowBankedCode
		.dsection banked
LowBankedEnd:

